{"4616480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tiny Leaf Kingdom", "steam_appid": 4616480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616480/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1776407885\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616480/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1776407885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616480/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1776407885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what they left behind wasn’t peace.<br>It was <strong>weapons and armor</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tiny Leaf Kingdom</strong> is a <strong>third-person (TPS), level-based action adventure</strong> where you control a <strong>green leaf warrior</strong> trying to survive in the middle of a war that has lasted for years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your enemies are the <strong>red leaves</strong>.<br>They don’t plan. They don’t hide.<br>They come in numbers… and they don’t stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, on the other hand, must rely on your reflexes, your wits, and the gear you find along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Swords, Axes, and Armor That’s Slightly Too Big</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616480/extras/464e8dcd9843a9994b4532608f0f2198.poster.avif?t=1776407885\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616480/extras/464e8dcd9843a9994b4532608f0f2198.webm?t=1776407885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616480/extras/464e8dcd9843a9994b4532608f0f2198.mp4?t=1776407885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in this war is simple:<br><strong>find good gear and use it at the right moment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons once made for humans are now in the hands of leaf warriors. Rusty swords, heavy axes, and helmets that never quite fit… They may look strange at first, but once the fighting starts, every piece matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through new levels, you’ll discover stronger <strong>loot</strong>, <strong>upgrade your equipment</strong>, and shape your own fighting style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes a single axe can change the outcome of a battle.<br>Sometimes it just makes you look ridiculous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both are part of this world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Change Your Power — Take New Forms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The greatest advantage of green leaves is their ability to <strong>adapt</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the skill system, you can take on the powers of different creatures:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jaguar Form</strong> — Fast, aggressive, and deadly. Perfect for overwhelming enemies in close combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eagle Form</strong> — Provides mobility and agility. Useful for escaping danger or reaching key positions quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spider Form</strong> — Patient and strategic. Opens new ways to gain advantage in difficult situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choosing the right form at the right time is the key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform at the wrong moment…<br>and you might regret it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Increasing Challenge, Level by Level</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616480/extras/a3c213d2e892e9df8a726b2e4b580ada.poster.avif?t=1776407885\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616480/extras/a3c213d2e892e9df8a726b2e4b580ada.webm?t=1776407885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616480/extras/a3c213d2e892e9df8a726b2e4b580ada.mp4?t=1776407885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression in Tiny Leaf Kingdom is <strong>level-based</strong>. Each new stage introduces tougher enemies and new combat challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some levels demand careful movement in tight spaces.<br>Others throw waves of enemies directly at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you move forward, enemies become faster, stronger, and more dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And sometimes…<br>you’ll face a <strong>Boss</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss Fights — The Real Test</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616480/extras/8b4b6ed69fcf9e328fa02e2c25ed15eb.poster.avif?t=1776407885\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616480/extras/8b4b6ed69fcf9e328fa02e2c25ed15eb.webm?t=1776407885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616480/extras/8b4b6ed69fcf9e328fa02e2c25ed15eb.mp4?t=1776407885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss fight pushes you to use everything you’ve learned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The right gear.<br>The right skill.<br>The right timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses aren’t just powerful — they test your patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when you finally defeat them…<br>it feels truly earned.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cozy Looks, Chaotic Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Tiny Leaf Kingdom may look <strong>cozy and charming</strong> at first glance. Small characters, colorful environments, and a warm atmosphere…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But once the fighting begins, everything changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crowds of enemies, fast-paced combat, and unpredictable moments keep you constantly alert. The world may look small, but the battles inside it are anything but.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616480/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1776407885\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616480/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1776407885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616480/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1776407885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what they left behind wasn’t peace.<br>It was <strong>weapons and armor</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tiny Leaf Kingdom</strong> is a <strong>third-person (TPS), level-based action adventure</strong> where you control a <strong>green leaf warrior</strong> trying to survive in the middle of a war that has lasted for years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your enemies are the <strong>red leaves</strong>.<br>They don’t plan. They don’t hide.<br>They come in numbers… and they don’t stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, on the other hand, must